LOOT KE AAYI HAI WATAN DIL KO SAMBHALE ZAINAB <br>
 SAH GAYI SHAAM MEIN BHI ZULM NIRALEY ZAINAB<br>
<br>
1. HO CHUKEY AOUN O MOHD BHI NISAR E SHABBIR <br>
 KAR CHUKI UNKO BHI KHALIQ KE HAWALEY ZAINAB<br>
<br>
2. IBNE SHABBAR KA BADAN HOGAYA RAN MEIN PAMAAL <br>
 SE GAYI DIL PE MAGAR ZULM KE BHALEY ZAINAB<br>
<br>
3. KHAK MEIN MILGAYI AKBER KI JAWANI NANA <br>
 KIS TARHA APNE KALEJE KO SHAMBHALEY ZAINAB<br>
<br>
4. BHAI NE SINAYE AKBER SE SEENA KHACHI <br>
 HAI GHAM KO YEH KIS TARHA SEENEY SE NIKALEY ZAINAB<br>
<br>
5. QABREY ZEHRA PE THA ZAINAB E MUZTAR KA BAYAN <br>
 KAR CHUKI HAQ PE GOAD KI PAALEY ZAINAB<br>
<br>
6. TEHNIYAT AAYI YEH ZEHRA KI SADA MARQAD SE <br>
 TUJH KO KOUN MERI JAAN SAMBHALEY ZAINAB<br>
<br>
